            <div class="cfs-prose">
                <h2 id="what-runs-where">What runs where</h2>
                <div class="cfs-table-wrap"><table class="cfs-table-stack">
                    <thead><tr><th>Work</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td>Listening to Twitch, Kick and tip services, and deciding which automations run</td><td data-label="Where">CertiFried server</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Chat replies and timers</td><td data-label="Where">CertiFried server: the CertiFried bot account on Twitch, Kick Defender on Kick</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Title, category, clips, polls, predictions, raids, ads</td><td data-label="Where">CertiFried server, using the permission you gave with the Stream bot grant</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>OBS scenes, sources, audio, filters, recording, screenshots</td><td data-label="Where">Studio, through OBS WebSocket on your PC</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Sounds and hotkeys</td><td data-label="Where">Studio, on the output device you choose</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Voice command recognition</td><td data-label="Where">Studio, with the speech recognition built into Windows</td></tr>
