                        <tr><td>Docks in OBS</td><td data-label="Where">Pages on certifriedmultitool.com, opened by OBS with a dock key</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Lights on your network (Govee LAN, Philips Hue, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Elgato) and Logitech Litra on USB</td><td data-label="Where">Studio, on your network and USB</td></tr>
